.TH START-MU2EDAQ-DATAFORMAT-VIEWER.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-dataformat-viewer t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
start-mu2edaq-dataformat-viewer.sh \- control-room launcher for the data format viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B start\-mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.sh
.RI [ viewer-argument ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Standardised Mu2e control-room start script, run by
.B crs-app start dataformat-viewer
(entry
.B dataformat\-viewer
in
.IR mu2edaq\-controlroom\-setup/config/apps.yaml ,
.BR "ports: {listen: 7755}" ,
session
.BR daq\-aux ).
It changes to its own directory, exports
.B CRS_PORT_LISTEN
(default 7755) and
.B DISPLAY
(default
.BR :0 ),
picks
.I ./venv/bin/python
if executable or
.B python3
otherwise, and starts
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.py (1)
in the background with
.BR nohup ,
appending output to
.IR dataformat\-viewer.log .
After one second it checks that the process is alive and writes its PID to
.IR dataformat\-viewer.pid .
If that file names a live process it reports it and exits 0.
.PP
The viewer does not start listening by itself; the operator presses
.B Start listening
in the window.
.SH OPTIONS
Arguments are passed to the viewer
.RB ( \-\-config
.IR FILE ,
.IR formats_dir ).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CRS_PORT_LISTEN
Listen port shown in the window and announced by discovery; overrides
.BR viewer.port .
.TP
.B DISPLAY
X display; default
.BR :0 .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I dataformat\-viewer.pid
.TP
.I dataformat\-viewer.log
Not rotated.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 when started or already running; 1 if the process died within one second.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
\&./start\-mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.sh
CRS_PORT_LISTEN=7756 ./start\-mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.sh \-\-config config/mu2e\-viewer.yaml
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR stop\-mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.sh (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.py (1),
.BR bootstrap.sh (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
